  "description": "<h2>Scholarship overview</h2>\n<p>Massey's Alumni Doctoral Scholarship is a university award for eligible graduates pursuing doctoral research. The published NZD 90,000 value is a total across the award period, with fee support, rather than a stipend of NZD 90,000 each year.</p>\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Eligible Massey doctoral subjects</li><li>Research training</li><li>Doctoral study</li></ul>\n<h2>Funding and duration</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Award or position</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">PhD scholarship / studentship</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Stipend / salary</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">NZD 90,000 total over three years, plus fees</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Three years</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Applicant eligibility</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Eligible Massey alumni</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Further conditions</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Massey alumni; total award is not an annual cash stipend.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Application dates</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Recruitment status</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Upcoming: opens 1 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Deadline / consideration round</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">1 February 2027</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Location</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">New Zealand</td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>How to Apply</h2>\n<ol><li>Review the scholarship conditions alongside the doctoral programme’s admission requirements.</li><li>Complete the admission, scholarship or nomination steps specified by the host; do not assume one submission covers every stage.</li><li>Submit by the deadline for your applicant category, or follow the stated consideration round where applications are rolling.</li></ol>\n<h2>About Massey University</h2>\n<p>Massey offers doctoral research in science, food technology and other disciplines. Its scholarship portfolio includes alumni awards and subject-specific funding, with eligibility and application dates set out for each award.</p>\n<p><strong>Official details:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.massey.ac.nz/study/scholarships-and-awards/massey-university-alumni-doctoral-scholarship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Read the programme or project information</a></p>\n<p><strong>Application route:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.massey.ac.nz/study/scholarships-and-awards/massey-university-alumni-doctoral-scholarship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Follow the official application instructions</a></p><h2>Application guides</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-email-phd-supervisor-uk-7-templates\">How to Email a PhD Supervisor: 7 Templates and Practical Tips</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nextapply.co.uk/articles/how-to-read-phd-job-advertisement-before-applying\">How to Read a PhD Job Advert: Funding, Eligibility and Application Steps</a></li></ul>",
